Z||000006||HugGRRRFiero||10-02-2000||05:04 PM||||I know Wade, the second time I read your question it somewhat sounded to me that you were saying the Aztek will be the next best Pontiac vehicle to do engine swaps since the Fiero.  I was just kidding there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hmmm... not sure if you can get real big tires under those, look at the clearance with just regular sized tires.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> not much.  I'd say if you want to put 35" tires under one then take one and bolt the body on top a Jeep or blazer chassis.  Someone have a graphics program handy?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||12
